'''Tailwind''' is a [[buff]] that grants the user 8% increased [[action speed]] for 4 seconds.

==Mechanics==
The buff itself cannot stack, but the effects of Tailwind can be increased by modifiers to [[Buff Effect]], which can currently only be obtained through the use of {{il|Ichimonji}}, or Effect of Tailwind (e.g. {{psl|Gathering Winds}}).

Tailwind can exist both as a standalone buff, or as an Aura-like effect from Gathering Winds.

